      "text": [
        "_RealAudio 14.4=Use for speech over 14.4 Kbps modems. This is the original RealAudio 14.4 Codec.mRealAudio 28.8=Use for general mono content over 28.8 Kbps modems. This is the original RealAudio 28.8 Codec.GRealAudio 28.8 Mono Voice=Use to optimize speech over 28.8 Kbps modems.aRealAudio 28.8 Mono Pop=Use for musical selections that include snare drums, cymbals, and vocals.xRealAudio 28.8 Mono Instrumental=Use for instrumental, classical, and other music needing the widest frequency response.5RealAudio 28.8 Stereo=Use for general stereo content.GRealAudio ISDN Mono=Use for general mono content over IDSN connections.CRealAudio ISDN Stereo=Use for stereo content over ISDN connections.ORealAudio Dual ISDN Mono=Use for optimal quality for mono content (CD Quality).RRealAudio Dual ISDN Stereo=Use for optimal quality for stereo (Broadcast Quality)."
      ]
    }
